# ==============================================================================
# Database: Well-Known TCP/UDP Ports & Service Names
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Field Schema:
#   Port or Port-Range | Protocol (tcp/udp) | Service Description
#
# Rules for Adding Entries:
#   1. Single ports take priority over ranges (e.g. 8080 before 8000-8999).
#   2. The parser automatically sanitizes descriptions into clean lowercase 
#      hyphenated service names (e.g., 'Immich Web API' -> 'immich-web-api').
#   3. Spaces around pipes '|' are automatically trimmed.
#
# Example:
#   22|tcp|SSH Remote Access
#   2283|tcp|Immich Web API
#   5000-5010|tcp|Custom Media Streaming Range
# ==============================================================================
